The "KOEI TECMO WebStore" is {{open_browser href=https://www.gamecity.ne.jp/atelier/resleriana/ktstore/}}here{{/open_browser}}

*After logging in, on mobile select the three horizontal lines in the upper right ⇒ username, or on PC select the username in the upper right to navigate to the serial code entry screen.

We are sending you a serial code that can be exchanged for Mana Shards x20 at the "KOEI TECMO WebStore."

*If you delete this mail, you will not be able to view the serial code. Please do not delete this mail until you have used the code.

